WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.140 --> 00:00:02.864
Your agent can text you now, on iMessage!

2
00:00:02.884 --> 00:00:05.364
Start a big job, and walk away.

3
00:00:05.384 --> 00:00:08.371
The second it’s done, your agent texts you!

4
00:00:08.391 --> 00:00:09.934
Out and about?

5
00:00:09.954 --> 00:00:12.353
Text your Mac from your phone.

6
00:00:12.373 --> 00:00:15.776
It does the work, and texts you back!

7
00:00:15.796 --> 00:00:17.914
Drop it into a group chat.

8
00:00:17.934 --> 00:00:21.095
Now the whole team can ask it anything!

9
00:00:21.115 --> 00:00:23.074
Setup takes one minute.

10
00:00:23.094 --> 00:00:27.910
Copy the prompt, paste it into your agent, and it sets everything up!

11
00:00:27.930 --> 00:00:31.608
In every chat, it answers as you, or as itself.

12
00:00:31.628 --> 00:00:33.099
Your call!

13
00:00:33.119 --> 00:00:34.126
iMessage Connector.

14
00:00:34.146 --> 00:00:34.784
Free.

15
00:00:34.804 --> 00:00:35.652
Copy the prompt.

16
00:00:35.672 --> 00:00:37.670
Your agent does the rest!
